<title>NETHERLANDS: Fortis Amev H1 up.</title>
<headline>Fortis Amev H1 up.</headline>
<dateline>UTRECHT, Netherlands 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>H1 1996</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>FORTIS AMEV --</p>
<p>    Net earnings per share (guilders)	2.19  vs  1.87</p>
<p>    Interim dividend (guilders)		0.68  vs  0.624</p>
<p>    Net profit				   398    vs 335</p>
<p>NOTE - Fortis AMEV of the Netherlands and Fortis AG of Belgium jointly own banking and insurance group Fortis.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
